enshot3.png", "id": "1391543485249581", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824592_1391543488582914_2552783215541715767_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=31Oh0_9b-AAQ7kNvwH7yKjV&_nc_oc=AdrGtcTAbTGyQBimnITKLffuPvg6QbtLRpOREvFgISt9vAG7DcpTUDosyDTswj_9dL0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSv86R_ybIwsjjP1t1mFUwqOh0RUffY4aPqIJ7_TfLLwA&oe=6B071C39"}, {"file_name": "screenshot4.png", "id": "4067422416841650", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830599_4067422420174983_2260996550380276533_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YA3-VgofxT4Q7kNvwENSKPT&_nc_oc=AdrnelCNZxuLrr684nDhcmMcfGGO3-Xq89c5DLWxmWUhNko-v_AcvM7zE69OTc5Laz8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR43u5rZLZE0_pYxDWWzBpFblbsIguqoP4TawiqkNeb8A&oe=6B07114C"}, {"file_name": "screenshot5.png", "id": "738539269143695", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830589_738539272477028_2490874811966012004_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=D5Ig7nNSGVwQ7kNvwFIZQW0&_nc_oc=AdrRQDzXGGL_9U0n8gkgFWYk3bb0c91tIHjZlNgSPEv3UWMhlO9Io3twT4oqrMgRPQo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQGmqGTbiSpl8F9pb7q7KpAtryy0FJVh4IJ9y32FPcRBg&oe=6B071FF9"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Landscape.png", "id": "1536060407557291", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507823854_1536060410890624_9222553092136700266_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-m_CUXaDAeoQ7kNvwEcm0o7&_nc_oc=AdpjhZ1kRorZjj7rTCnnzhZqCSwwlGIMO2cT401rF5t_GOjh-6VpWaMPoE-UeXZWi58&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTB39lm8Co2AlLsZJJfHcCNXCVsKZXYY1H_RHuCYYW5Ng&oe=6B0716C9"}, "display_name": "Crane Signals", "keywords": ["crane", "signals", "hand", "training", "learning"], "long_description": "Crane Signals is a groundbreaking initiative aimed at teaching users the Standard Method hand signals required to communicate with a crane operator and offers a safe, risk-free environment to practice hand signal communications with a responsive crane, load, and realistic physics. Leveraging immersive technologies like VR and hand tracking, we're creating an unparalleled learning journey that captivates and educates like never before. \n\nKey Features:\nStandard Method Tutorial-- Immerse yourself in a realistic simulation that brings learning to life by discovering what each hand signal communicates to the crane operator. \nPractice Your skills-- Now that you know your signals, practice moving a load as you signal to the crane operator.\nHand Tracking-- By using your hands, you learn through embodied cognition, improving retention of knowledge. No more hand controller batteries!\n\nImpact and Benefits: \nCrane Signals promises to revolutionize crane signal training by engaging the trainee in an immersive and risk-free virtual environment. No need to sacrifice the productivity of real-world equipment and operators in order to train. Asynchronous training offers flexibility to those charged with training new personnel, and devices can be sent to training sites at a fraction of the cost associated with moving personnel and equipment. ", "short_description": "Crane Signals is a hand-tracking Virtual Reality (VR) application aimed at teaching users the Standard Method hand signals required to communicate with a crane operator. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://designori.online/crane_signals/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Designori LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://designori.net/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id":